        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu ɛ bo̱o̱th palädan in di̱i̱t",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ luɔt kä min lat nɛy ɛ, ɛ ɣöö ta̱nɛ kɛ bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t, mi ci nyuur kui̱c cuëëc kɔam Kua̱r in di̱i̱t nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛ cɛ lät ala bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t guäth in Rɛl Gɔɔydɛ rɔ rɛy kɛmɛkä palä in thuɔ̱k min ca cuŋ ɛ Kuäär ni Kuoth, a /ci mɔ a raan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca bööth palä tin di̱t diaal kuany kɛ ɣöö bikɛ muc kɛnɛ luuri thöp Kuoth, kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ bo̱o̱th palä ɛmɛ bɛ dhil tekɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r mi bɛ thöp bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ duŋ mi tëë wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, /cɛ dee met a bo̱o̱th palä ɛ tɛk, kɛ ɣöö te bööth palä ti thöpkɛ muc kɛ ciaŋ ŋuɔ̱t thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la̱t in lät kɛn ɛ ala bööth palä jɛn ɛ ta̱a̱ kä ɛ ti̱eep kä min nhial, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cua Muthɛ luek mëë go̱o̱rɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛmɛ palä cuŋ, cu Kuoth ɛ, jiök i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 25:40.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ŋäcni jɛ a gɔaa ɛn ɣöö bi ti diaal la̱t ce̱tnikɛ tëë cä nyuɔ̱th ji̱ wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ, ca Kritho ka̱m la̱t bo̱thä palä mi gɔaa ni jɛn kä lätkiɛn, ce̱tkɛ min gɔaa ni mat ruac ëë cɛ la̱t kam Kuɔth kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ, kɛ ɣöö cuŋɛ kä tin a gɔw tëë ca lat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi thilɛ mi ci dueer kä mat ruac ëë nhiam, kä thilɛ mi dëë lɛ go̱r mat ruac in rɛwdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Kuoth diw jek kä nɛɛkɛ mëë wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
